{
  "__comment": "infra/observability/grafana/ops-dashboards/model-lanes.json — GENERATED by intake_platform.ops_dashboards (INT-481). Do not edit: change the module and re-emit with scripts/observability/ops_dashboards.py --emit; tests/observability/test_ops_dashboards.py fails on drift.",
  "uid": "intake-ops-model-lanes",
