    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Spend against the budgets",
      "description": "The cost module's budget alerts (infra/observability/cost-rules.yaml, INT-190). CostBudgetNotConfigured means the budget has no limit in infra/costs/unit-prices.yaml (HB-O8); CostBudgetExceeded and CostBudgetIncomplete appear once limits and prices are set. No series on this branch meters hosted-model spend in USD, so no spend figure is drawn.",
